  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reconstruction of Ujar-Yevlakh Road Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at reconstruction of the severely deteriorated existing 40 years old single carriageway Ujar_Yevlakh road and installation of the required safety devices to improve the quality of transport on the road by reducing vehicle operating cost, travel time, accidents and negative environmental impacts (vehicle emissions).</narrative>
  </description>
